Status** | Valid (as of April 2023) | Confirmed by MISUMI Corporation. |\n\n[Page 73]\nThis page is a formal **UKCA Declaration of Conformity** issued by Misumi Corporation. It serves as a legal document confirming that a specific range of products manufactured by Misumi meets the necessary safety and technical standards required for sale within the United Kingdom (UK).\n\nSince the page contains structured data (standards, parties, and compliance lists) rather than narrative text or diagrams, the summary is presented using detailed sections and tables to ensure all key data is captured.\n\n***\n\n## 📜 Detailed Summary: UKCA Declaration of Conformity\n\n### I. Purpose and Scope of the Document\n**Document Title:** UKCA Declaration of Conformity\n**Purpose:** To legally declare that the products specified comply with the technical requirements and safety standards governing the supply of machinery and related electrical components in the UK.\n**Compliance Status:** The products are deemed compliant with the **Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008**.\n\n### II. Regulatory Compliance (The Standards)\nThe declaration confirms adherence to several specific British and European standards.\n\n| Regulation Type | Standard Code | Year | Description / Scope |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Core Safety** | UK SI 2008 No. 1597 | 2008 | Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations |\n| **Electromagnetic**| UK SI 2016 No. 1091 | 2016 | Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations |\n| **General Standard** | BS EN 620 | 2021 | A specific safety standard applied to the products. |\n\n### III. Responsible Parties (The "Who")\nThe declaration clearly identifies the manufacturer, the designated importer, and the authorized representative responsible for the product compliance in the UK.\n\n| Role | Company Name | Address |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Manufacturer** | Misumi Corporation | 1-6-5 Kudannimani, Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo 102-8583, Japan |\n| **Importer** | Misumi Europa GmbH