| 1.5 |\n| **50** | 0.4 | 1.8 |\n| **60** | 0.3 | 2.0 |\n\n*(Note: The ratio generally increases as the belt speed increases.)*\n\n---\n\n## ⚙️ 4.3.36 CVSTCE (Timing Belt Transmission System)\n\nThis model is designed for timing belt systems, offering precision in power transmission.\n\n### 🖼️ Diagram and General Overview\nThe image displays a drive unit designed for synchronization via a timing belt.\n\n### ✨ Special Features\n*   **Belt Type:** Timing belt conveyor, single belt.\n*   **Pulley Diameter:** Ø 19, 20 mm.\n*   **Drive:** Head drive.\n*   **Cooling:** Space-saving design.\n\n### 📏 Technical Data\n| Specification | Value |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Belt Width** | 10–20 |\n| **Length** | 245–2000 |\n| **Torque (Output)** | 3–7 |\n| **Voltage** | 230 |\n| **Frequency** | 50 |\n\n***(Note: Graphs and detailed tables for this model are structured in the layout but contain incomplete or illegible data in the provided image.)***\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Summary of Further Information (Navigation)\n\nThe page concludes with standard navigational links for supplementary technical details:\n\n*   **Connection:** Details regarding coupling and mounting.\n*   **Belt Characteristics:** Specific data on belt materials and types.\n*   **Accessories:** Information on add-on components and parts.\n\n[Page 34]\nThis page provides detailed technical specifications and operational data for two models of timing belt conveyors manufactured by Misumi: the **4.3.37 CVSTRE** (Single Belt) and the **4.3.38 CVGTAE** (Double Track).\n\n---\n\n## ⚙️ Overview and General Specifications\n\nBoth products are designed as industrial timing belt conveyors. Key general parameters include:\n\n*   **Voltage (V):** 230 V\n*   **Frequency (Hz):** 50 Hz\n\n### 1. Model 4.3.37 CVSTRE (Single Belt Conveyor)\n\nThis model is designed for single-belt operation and emphasizes space efficiency.\n\n#### 🔎 Special Features:\n*   Timing belt conveyor, single belt design.\n*   Utilizes pulleys and a central drive system.\n*   Features a space-saving design.\n\n#### 📊 Technical Data (Dimensions and Weight):\n| Parameter | Specification | Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Width (mm)** | 10, 20 | Variable width options. |\n| **Length (mm)** | 330 – 2000 | Range of available lengths. |\n| **Weight (kg\\*)** | 6 | Approx. weight (variable based on model). |\n| **Power (W\\*)** | Variable | Power requirement (marked with \\*). |\n\n#### 📈 Operational Diagram: Conveyor Capacity\nThis graph illustrates the relationship between **Belt Speed (Hz)** and **Conveyor Capacity**.\n\n*   **Key Trend:** The capacity starts high at low frequencies and generally decreases as the operating speed increases.\n*   **Data Points (Example Ranges):**\n    *   At 10 Hz, the capacity is highest (e.g., >12.5 units).\n    *   At 60 Hz, the capacity is significantly lower (e.g., 1.0 to 2.0 units).\n\n### 2. Model 4.3.38 CVGTAE (Double Track Conveyor)\n\nThis model is designed for heavier-duty, dual-track operation.\n\n#### 🔎 Special Features:\n*   Timing belt conveyor, double track design.\n*   Utilizes pulleys and is driven by a head drive.\n*   Incorporates sleepers, allowing sensors to be installed in the gap.\n\n#### 📊 Technical Data (Dimensions and Weight):\n| Parameter | Specification | Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Width (mm)** | 20 | Fixed width. |\n| **Length (mm)** | 255 – 3000 | Range of available lengths. |\n| **Weight (kg\\*)** | 9 | Approx. weight (variable based on model). |\n| **Power (W\\*)** | Variable | Power requirement (marked with \\*). |\n\n#### 📐 Operational Diagram: Gearhead Reduction Ratio\nThis graph illustrates the relationship between **Belt Speed (Hz)** and the **Gearhead Reduction Ratio**.\n\n*   **Key Trend:** The reduction ratio is generally highest at lower speeds and drops sharply as the operating speed increases.\n*   **Data Points (Example):**\n    *   At 50 Hz, the ratio is moderate (e.g., 4.0 to 5.0).\n    *   At 60 Hz, the ratio is lower (e.g., 2.0 to 3.0).\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Summary of Key Technical Data Tables\n\nThe graphs include supporting tables detailing specific performance metrics at various frequencies:\n\n### A. Conveyor Capacity Data (CVSTRE - Single Belt)\n| Hz (Frequency) | Capacity (Example Range) |\n| :---: | :---: |\n| **10** | High (e.g., 12.5 - 14.0) |\n| **20** | Medium-High (e.g., 8.0 - 10.0) |\n| **30** | Medium (e.g., 5.0 - 7.0) |\n| **40** | Medium-Low (e.g., 3.0 - 4.0) |\n| **50** | Low (e.g., 2.0 - 3.0) |\n| **60** | Lowest (e.g., 1.0 - 2.0) |\n\n### B. Gearhead Reduction Ratio Data (CVGTAE - Double Track)\n| Hz (Frequency) | Reduction Ratio (Example Range) |\n| :---: | :---: |\n| **50** | Moderate (e.g., 4.0 - 5.0) |\n| **60** | Low (e.g., 2.0 - 3.0) |\n\n---\n\n## ℹ️ Further Information\n\nThe bottom section directs users to supplementary documentation:\n\n*   **Connection:** From page 43\n*   **Belt Characteristics:** From page 36\n*   **Accessories:** From page 63\n\n[Page 35]\nThis page provides detailed technical specifications and operational data for two models of modular conveyor drive systems manufactured by MISUMI: **4.3.39 CVGTBE** and **4.3.40 CVGTNE**.\n\n---\n\n## 📄 Product Summary: MISUMI Conveyor Drive Systems\n\nThe document is an excerpt from "Conveyor Systems - Operating Instructions," detailing two similar, high-performance timing belt conveyor drives.\n\n### ➡️ Product 1: 4.3.39 CVGTBE (Left Side)\n\nThis model is described as a timing belt system suitable for conveyors with double tracks.\n\n#### **Key Features and Specifications:**\n*   **Special Features:** Timing belt, conveyors, double track.\n*   **Technical Parameters:**\n    *   **Belt Width:** 80–300 mm\n    *   **Length:** 265–3000 mm\n    *   **Weight:** 9.1–24.3 kg\n    *   **Power (W):** 25–200 W\n    *   **Frequency:** 50 Hz\n\n#### **Technical Diagram: Torque vs. Speed Curve**\nThe diagram illustrates the relationship between **Torque (N•m)** and **Belt Speed (m/s)** for both 50 Hz and 60 Hz operating frequencie